			<item>
				<title>Installation</title>
				<link>https://hudocs.com/docs/1.0/installation/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://hudocs.com/docs/1.0/installation/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;This page is an example of how installation documentation could be structured for a hypothetical version 1.0. The instructions below are for demonstration purposes only and do not represent an actual installation.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;requirements&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  Requirements&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;article-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#39;Anchor: Requirements&#39; href=&#34;#requirements&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Hugo 0.164.0 or higher&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Git installed&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;install&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  Install&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;article-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#39;Anchor: Install&#39; href=&#34;#install&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;In a real project, version 1.0 could be added as a Git submodule:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;git submodule add https://github.com/example/project themes/example&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Configuration</title>
				<link>https://hudocs.com/docs/1.0/configuration/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://hudocs.com/docs/1.0/configuration/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;This page is an example of how configuration options could be documented for a hypothetical version 1.0. The settings shown here are for demonstration purposes only.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;basic-configuration&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  Basic configuration&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;article-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#39;Anchor: Basic configuration&#39; href=&#34;#basic-configuration&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The following example shows a basic configuration using a TOML file:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-toml&#34; data-lang=&#34;toml&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;baseURL&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;https://example.com/&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;title&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;My Documentation&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;params&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;description&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;Example documentation site&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;author&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;Example&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;theme-settings&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  Theme settings&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;article-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#39;Anchor: Theme settings&#39; href=&#34;#theme-settings&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Additional options could be defined under the &lt;code&gt;params&lt;/code&gt; section:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-toml&#34; data-lang=&#34;toml&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;params&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;showVersion&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;kc&#34;&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;enableSearch&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;kc&#34;&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;showLastUpdated&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;kc&#34;&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;show-version&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  Show version&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;article-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#39;Anchor: Show version&#39; href=&#34;#show-version&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Controls whether the current documentation version is displayed:&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Changelog</title>
				<link>https://hudocs.com/docs/1.0/changelog/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://hudocs.com/docs/1.0/changelog/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;This page is an example of how a changelog could be structured for a project. The versions and changes listed below are fictional and are provided for demonstration purposes only.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;120&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  1.2.0&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;article-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#39;Anchor: 1.2.0&#39; href=&#34;#120&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Added&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Added a new documentation navigation system.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Added built-in search support.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Added version indicators to documentation pages.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Added support for displaying the last updated date.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improved&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Improved page loading performance.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Improved navigation on mobile devices.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Improved the documentation layout and typography.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fixed&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
